Today I solved leetcode question 3075:Maximize happiness of selected children.

Description: We are given an array of integers and an integer k.
            We want to select k elements from array but with each turn value of remaining decreases by 1.
            And we want to return maximum number of integers we can get.
            And numbers cannot go below zero.

Solution: First we sort the array.
          Then we create 2 variables, answer and current, both with values 0.
          Now we will start our for loop but from the end of the array till start.
          Now first we will check if current is equal to k. If yes then break else continue.
          Then we will check if current element minus current is greater than zero or not. If yes add current element minus current to answer.
          If it is less than zero then break.
          And at last return the answer.
